          "docs": "Create a new Activity Results Code, for example SUCCESS, END, CALLAGAIN.  These codes are used when you complete an activity.  You need to specify an Activity Result Code as part of that completion process. <p><strong>OperationId:</strong>postActivityResultsConfig</p>"
